    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "13 The Walk, Glenveigh is a large four bedroom semi-detached home located in a much sought after housing estate situated on the prestigious Boyne Road which is located within close proximity to Navan Town. The property is situated on a small quiet a cul de sac, is not overlooked to the rear and benefits from a large cobble lock drive way at the front. The house is presented to the market in good condition and has been well maintained by the current homeowners. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises of spacious layout consisting of a sitting room with a bay window to the front, a guest WC, utility and separate kitchen and dinging room to the rear. The first floor includes three double bedrooms with a master ensuite, a single bedroom and a main bathroom.\r\n\r\nGlenveigh is extremely well maintained by its residents and the estate is within walking distance from Navan town centre, offering homeowners immediate proximity to a good array of schools, supermarkets, leisure facilities and restaurants. The property is located just a 30 minutes drive to Blanchardstown, 40 minutes to Dublin City and 40 minutes to Dublin Airport."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Excellent location off the Boyne Road, Navan and within walking distance to The Ramparts.\r\nSpacious Family Home, great living space and very well appointed.\r\nLarge living room with an open fireplace & a bay window.\r\nThe owner occupants have continuously modernised and improved the specification over years."
      },
      {
